# ── Generated databases — regenerable, kept out of git ───────────────────────
# GitHub hard-rejects any single file over 100 MB, and quran_sciences.db is
# ~132 MB: every push was refused by the server, which is why 175 commits sat
# unpushed while releases carried only APKs. Both files are build artifacts
# produced by scripts/, not sources — the same rule this repo already applies
# to scripts/book_text_build/. They are still bundled into the APK, so a build
# machine must have them: see assets/data/README.md for how to regenerate or
# download each one.
assets/data/quran_sciences.db
assets/data/hadith.db
